<title>USA: PHLX to list options on Bema Gold Corp May 8.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list options on Bema Gold Corp May 8.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said Friday it will open options on Bema Gold Corp stock May 8.</p>
<p>The options will have opening strike prices of 5, 7-1/2 and 10 and will trade on the March expiration cycle, with initial expiries in June, July, September and December. The position limit will be 10,500 contracts. Group One Ltd will be the specialist, PHLX said. ((DerivativesDesk(312)408-8750)) E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com</p>
